# Package Management Standards

- ALWAYS use `uv` commands for Python (`uv run`, `uv add`, etc.)
- ALWAYS use `pnpm` for Node.js (never npm or yarn)
- Use `pyproject.toml` [project.scripts] for Python commands (not Makefiles)
- Follow existing project structure for dependencies and scripts
